{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_025_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d50f12259053668caf0983a690ee9af86c33769c73ef188920a2e9c8855f0419",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "text": "甜香、努力与友情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1659fe408b29902069f8b82e8b25074eaf56919370699503e58e598161628e68",
      "text": "最近朱雀很在意玄武身上飘着一股甜甜的香味。\n但玄武却说自己毫无头绪。\n然而，其实玄武是在为了朱雀的生日\n秘密做着某项准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "text": "甜香、努力与友情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cfa5ebcf8a80785fc33a49a14a9b4f5a88e4c732a2d7f864699028753d9deea",
      "text": "……以上就是今天的碰头会内容。\n有什么让您在意的点吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ca511159535dfb1a609d85c01d048049b34b9b29e7e7035de4d3ac254b47c2",
      "text": "哦！没问题！……不对，虽然不是工作上的事，\n但我有点在意的细节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f692e360bfe56a9bdc2593726835873ddb4d6a7d9d090e5e50b46deb0864f10",
      "text": "好的，请尽管直说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b22c959ce2b9cce260d4023c3e36ce7e5bae6946b8b5d9d44e2dfbcc3d9945",
      "text": "谢啦！制作人啊，\n你最近有没有闻到玄武身上有股甜甜的香味？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f356938bfe059fd97ed9a2c7fa9f89ddc3f1e92452739605e5ae09cbdb80598f",
      "text": "甜甜的香味……\n会吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:471237ba7c0b105fdfb7cd2b3606b6382209d6e624865799bbd65d895244be45",
      "text": "制作人没注意到啊。\n那可能是我的心理作用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2c23d6cc05a227d831aca75b8191379e54e73715d1c8335821d786db44407c4",
      "text": "去问玄武本人，\n他也说“有那种味道吗？”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20212e729006dbfa1d6f97ee816d7b557455f016bb142f20741a71f7f4eda1a9",
      "text": "算了，不管了。看来是我弄错了。\n不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b00cfff88820e68146058a036c6ba94b2882bd289284532c50227dd1b58e154",
      "text": "喵～～～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018e1149c0f61f7488e9f92ccc6bc00635cf209e8e6188b48f2181328cc331cb",
      "text": "（喵子好像欲言又止的样子……\n保险起见还是向玄武先生确认一下比较好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_02_1_2_025_02:1_2_025_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44deaffc038ce5300b230b60ce2f88cf6d83bd72879638b98c2be84df730358e",
      "text": "怎么啦喵子，肚子饿了吗？\n那就去吃饭吧。制作人，回头见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
